[E0436] Error: `w` is used after `named`, which it refers to, was changed
   ╭─[ err/317_is_chain_borrows/main.wip:9:9 ]
   │
 7 │     val cleared = named is .Some(w) && {
   │                                  ┬
   │                                  ╰── `w` refers to `named`
 8 │         named = .None
   │         ──┬──
   │           ╰──── `named` assigned here
 9 │         w.len() > 0
   │         ┬
   │         ╰── used here
   │
   │ Help: use `w` before `named` changes, or take what is needed from it before then
   │
   │ Note: a binding of a pattern on a place refers to the place, so the place must not change while the binding is still used
───╯
